{"pageProps":{"note":{"id":"notes.psychology.mapping-behavioral-patterns","title":"Mapping and Mitigating Behavioral Patterns","description":"Metode pemetaan pola berulang untuk menemukan akar masalah dan menentukan resolusi.","tags":["psychology","journaling","behavioral-analysis"],"custom":{"description":"Metode pemetaan pola berulang untuk menemukan akar masalah dan menentukan resolusi."},"fname":"notes.psychology.mapping-behavioral-patterns","type":"note","vault":{"fsPath":"vault"},"contentHash":"52ae51cb32243646c0505da2389bc1a7","updated":1782198659074,"created":1782198659074,"desc":"","links":[{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"notes.psychology.mapping-behavioral-patterns","id":"notes.psychology.mapping-behavioral-patterns","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.psychology","alias":"psychology","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.psychology"}},{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"notes.psychology.mapping-behavioral-patterns","id":"notes.psychology.mapping-behavioral-patterns","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.journaling","alias":"journaling","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.journaling"}},{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"notes.psychology.mapping-behavioral-patterns","id":"notes.psychology.mapping-behavioral-patterns","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.behavioral-analysis","alias":"behavioral-analysis","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.behavioral-analysis"}},{"type":"wiki","from":{"fname":"notes.psychology.mapping-behavioral-patterns","id":"notes.psychology.mapping-behavioral-patterns","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"notes.psychology.recurring-patterns-vs-incidents","position":{"start":{"line":28,"column":11,"offset":1358},"end":{"line":28,"column":63,"offset":1410},"indent":[]},"xvault":false,"sameFile":false,"to":{"fname":"notes.psychology.recurring-patterns-vs-incidents"}},{"type":"wiki","from":{"fname":"notes.psychology.mapping-behavioral-patterns","id":"notes.psychology.mapping-behavioral-patterns","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"private.growth.limited-care-framework","position":{"start":{"line":28,"column":65,"offset":1412},"end":{"line":28,"column":106,"offset":1453},"indent":[]},"xvault":false,"sameFile":false,"to":{"fname":"private.growth.limited-care-framework"}}],"anchors":{"mapping-and-mitigating-behavioral-patterns":{"type":"header","text":"Mapping and Mitigating Behavioral Patterns","value":"mapping-and-mitigating-behavioral-patterns","line":15,"column":0,"depth":1},"the-mapping-framework":{"type":"header","text":"The Mapping Framework","value":"the-mapping-framework","line":17,"column":0,"depth":2},"analyzing-the-pattern":{"type":"header","text":"Analyzing the Pattern","value":"analyzing-the-pattern","line":26,"column":0,"depth":2},"mitigation-strategy":{"type":"header","text":"Mitigation Strategy","value":"mitigation-strategy","line":32,"column":0,"depth":2}},"children":[],"parent":"k7whujrtxo2tvftwjvbq1jh","data":{}},"body":"<h1 id=\"mapping-and-mitigating-behavioral-patterns\">Mapping and Mitigating Behavioral Patterns<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#mapping-and-mitigating-behavioral-patterns\"></a></h1>\n<h1 id=\"mapping-and-mitigating-behavioral-patterns-1\">Mapping and Mitigating Behavioral Patterns<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#mapping-and-mitigating-behavioral-patterns-1\"></a></h1>\n<h2 id=\"the-mapping-framework\">The Mapping Framework<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#the-mapping-framework\"></a></h2>\n<p>Untuk memutus pola berulang, kita tidak bisa hanya mengandalkan niat. Kita perlu memetakan pola tersebut secara konkret menggunakan data.</p>\n<p><strong>Komponen Pemetaan (Journaling):</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>Event</strong>: Apa yang terjadi? (Hari, jam, situasi).</li>\n<li><strong>Emosi</strong>: Apa yang dirasakan? (Beri skor 1-5, misal: Malu 4/5, Iri 3/5).</li>\n<li><strong>Pikiran</strong>: Apa narasi internal yang muncul? (Misal: \"Gue paling tidak dilihat\").</li>\n<li><strong>Respon Fisik/Perilaku</strong>: Apa yang dilakukan tubuh dan tindakan nyata? (Misal: Diam, menarik diri).</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"analyzing-the-pattern\">Analyzing the Pattern<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#analyzing-the-pattern\"></a></h2>\n<p>Setelah data terkumpul, tarik garis untuk melihat:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Siapa</strong> yang memicu?</li>\n<li><strong>Kapan</strong> dan <strong>di mana</strong> biasanya terjadi?</li>\n<li><strong>Kenapa</strong> ini terjadi? (Cari emosi inti: <em>shame, guilt, burnout</em>, atau takut dieksploitasi).</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"mitigation-strategy\">Mitigation Strategy<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#mitigation-strategy\"></a></h2>\n<p>Mitigasi dilakukan dengan memotong rantai respons di titik-titik tertentu:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Level Pikiran</strong>: Menyadari bahwa narasi internal adalah \"suara protektif\", bukan hukum realitas.</li>\n<li><strong>Level Emosi</strong>: Memberi nama pada emosi untuk mengurangi intensitasnya.</li>\n<li><strong>Level Perilaku</strong>: Melakukan aksi kecil yang berbeda (misal: respons peduli terbatas).</li>\n<li><strong>Level Relasi</strong>: Memilih lingkungan yang memberikan feedback sehat, bukan sekadar afirmasi luka.</li>\n</ul>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>Atomic Idea</strong>: Fixing pola berulang butuh peta, bukan cuma niat.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>See also: <a href=\"/sotoy/notes/notes.psychology.recurring-patterns-vs-incidents\">Recurring Patterns vs Incidents</a>, <a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">private.growth.limited-care-framework (Private)</a></p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"tags\">Tags<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#tags\"></a></h2>\n<ol>\n<li><a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">psychology (Private)</a></li>\n<li><a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">journaling (Private)</a></li>\n<li><a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">behavioral-analysis (Private)</a></li>\n</ol>","noteIndex":{"id":"root","title":"Hello and Welcome! 👋","desc":"","updated":1778468084907,"created":1724251163400,"tags":["x","twitter"],"custom":{"nav_order":0,"permalink":"/"},"fname":"root","type":"note","vault":{"fsPath":"vault"},"contentHash":"fbada016be66dbd4790f7e49ede05b67","links":[{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"root","id":"root","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.x","alias":"x","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.x"}},{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"root","id":"root","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.twitter","alias":"twitter","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.twitter"}}],"anchors":{"find-more":{"type":"header","text":"Find More","value":"find-more","line":23,"column":0,"depth":2}},"children":["book-summaries","daily","handbook","notes","tags","til","zettel"],"parent":null,"data":{},"body":"\nWelcome to the homepage! I use Dendron to store and organize notes, ideas, and experiments I’m working on. Here are the main sections you’ll find on this site:\n\n1. **Learning Notes** — Practical notes on programming, recent technologies, and productivity tips.\n2. **Personal Projects** — Summaries of projects, experiments, and outcomes I’m working on or have completed.\n3. **Writings & Opinions** — Casual articles and reflections about technology, daily life, and other interesting topics.\n\nI’m constantly experimenting and learning. I hope the content here helps you as a reference, a starting point for discussion, or just light reading.\n\n> Why Dendron?\n>\nDendron helps keep notes organized. Its \"seed\" and \"vault\" concepts make it easy to structure content and find what you need.\n\n## Find More\n\nIf you wan